1.	What is the total number of, (a) men, and (b) women employed by the Department of External Affairs in each of Canada's representations abroad?
2.	With reference to the totals given in answer to question 1, (a) how many were born in Canada; (b) how many were born in other countries; (c) what countries, and how many in each; (d) how many received all of their education in Canada; (e) how many received part or all of their education in other countries; Of) what countries; and how many in each; (g) how many are able to use the Spanish language?
3.	What is the total number of, (a) men, and (.b) women employed by the Department of External Affairs, at Ottawra?
4.	With reference to the totals given in answ'er to question 3, (a) how many were born in Canada; (b) how many wore born in other countries; (c) what countries, and how many in each; (cl) how many received all of their education in Canada; (e) how many received part or all of their education in other countries;
(f) what countries; and how many in each;
(g) how many are able to use the Spanish language?
